  "accountLegalTitle": "Legal & disclosures",
  "accountLegalTermsTitle": "Terms of Service (summary)",
  "accountLegalTermsBody": "Chefii is provided for household kitchen organisation, cooking guidance and general nutrition education. You're responsible for food safety decisions in your home. Full terms will be published before public launch and require legal review.",
  "accountLegalPrivacyTitle": "Privacy Policy (summary)",
  "accountLegalPrivacyBody": "We collect what you enter or scan to run Chefii: kitchen items, receipts, recipes, meal records, and optional health information you choose to add. We process data in Canada where possible, use AI providers only with your consent and under data-processing agreements, never sell personal information, and let you export or delete your data at any time. Prepared to meet PIPEDA and applicable provincial health privacy laws; full policy subject to legal review.",
  "accountLegalMedicalTitle": "Medical limitations",
  "accountLegalMedicalBody": "Chefii does not diagnose, treat, cure or prevent any disease, and is not a medical device. Nutrition values are estimates. Glucose features are a personal journal and do not replace medical devices, alarms or your care team. Allergy screening relies on ingredient names and labels you check; it cannot guarantee a food is free of an allergen.",
  "accountLegalFoodSafetyTitle": "Food safety",
  "accountLegalFoodSafetyBody": "Freshness indicators are estimates based on typical storage times. Always follow package dates, safe storage temperatures and safe internal cooking temperatures.",
  "accountLegalEvidenceTitle": "Evidence methodology",
  "accountLegalEvidenceBody": "Nutrition statements come from national guidelines and authoritative references. Each shows its sources, evidence strength, limitations and review status. AI may rephrase approved statements but may not create new health claims.",
  "accountLegalAiTitle": "AI disclosure",
  "accountLegalAiBody": "Recipes marked \"Created by your AI chef\", receipt readings and photo suggestions are generated by AI and may contain mistakes. Illustrations are not photographs of your food.",
